<p>Hey <%= @resource.first_name_or_fallback %>,</p>

<p>
  Your Dabble Me account (<%= @resource.email %>) was locked after too many
  unsuccessful sign-in attempts. Use the link below to unlock it.
</p>

<p><%= link_to 'Unlock my account', unlock_url(@resource, unlock_token: @token) %></p>

<p>If this wasn't you, you can ignore this email. The account stays locked until that link is used.</p>

<p>
  <br>
  Thanks,
  <br>
  Dabble Me
</p>
